  "body": "## Summary\nImplements `DMX-DCP-MODEL-ROUTING-MVP-0007I` (NEXT-TRANCHE-001).\n\n- Adds `TrustedInputCapability` (private mint token; non-serializable)\n- Adds fail-closed `is_execution_eligible` (always False while adapters empty)\n- `active_trusted_adapters() == []` \u2014 **no mutation adapter enabled**\n- Focused tests + full `tests/unit/dcp` green\n\n## Non-claims\n- No runner/connector/MCP/Dopetask/TO/GitHub/live writes\n- No trusted mutation adapter enabled\n- `serialized_trust_supported: false`\n- Does **not** rewrite `RouteDecision.is_runnable` (allowlist forbid); residual disclosed for 0007T/A\n\n## Proof\n`proof/DMX-DCP-MODEL-ROUTING-MVP-0007I/`\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `pytest tests/unit/dcp/test_input_adapters.py`\n- [x] `pytest tests/unit/dcp`\n- [x] `ruff check` on touched files\n- [x] allowlist-only diff",
